  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows liraglutide has been in shortage since 2023-07-18 with multiple manufacturers listed as Current or To Be Discontinued",
  "headline_cites": ["E9", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows liraglutide injection has been in shortage since 2023-07-18 and remains current as of 2026-10-14 for Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Meitheal Pharmaceuticals Inc., and Novo Nordisk Inc.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E5", "E6", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. is listed as To Be Discontinued with an initial posting date of 2026-05-14 and related information stating discontinuation of manufacture.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 39 months.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No public FDA signal exists at our plants for this shortage.",
      "cites": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 64 units at 7.4 units per day providing 9 days on hand while Corvale General holds 62 units at 4.4 units per day providing 14 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Biocon Pharma Inc. which is not on FDA's shortage list today though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    }
  ]
}
